# Git-Secret Configuration
# ----------------------------------------------------
# 1. Protect local GPG files inside the secret folder
.gitsecret/keys/random_seed
.gitsecret/keys/trustdb.gpg

# 2. ALWAYS ignore your actual raw, unencrypted secret files!
# (Add the actual names of your plain-text secret files here)
.env
secrets.txt
config/private_keys.json

# 3. Explicitly ensure encrypted files are NEVER ignored
!*.secret
